# Docs: https://docs.docker.com/build/concepts/context/#dockerignore-files
# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile build stage reads, so a
# new top-level file never reaches `COPY . /app` unless it is listed here.
*
!LICENSE
!README.md
!assets/css/input.css
!content
!pyproject.toml
!src
!static
!uv.lock
# Generated files inside the allowed directories; the image builds its own stylesheet.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
static/dist/styles.css
